  "raw_code": "(rule!\n ;; Drop the header row+column; an interior cell lights with the shared\n ;; header color when its ROW header equals its COLUMN header (non-zero).\n (grid-from-fn (- h 1) (- w 1) (lambda (r c)\n   (let ((a (at g (+ r 1) 0)) (b (at g 0 (+ c 1))))\n     (if (and (!= a 0) (= a b)) a 0)))))",
